# The `toolchains` cell of a standalone komira checkout.
#
# The Mojo rules take their toolchain from `toolchains//:mojo` and
# `toolchains//:mojo_multi_numa`: the prelude's convention, where the
# `toolchains` cell belongs to the repository at the project root. Here that
# is komira itself. The toolchains are built from the pinned downloads in
# komira//tools/build/toolchains; see komira_mojo_toolchains in
# tools/build/toolchains/defs.bzl for why they are declared here.
#
# A repository using komira as a cell owns its `toolchains` cell: copy this
# file to its toolchains/BUCK (tools/build/consumer.buckconfig). To pin a
# different compiler, pass `compiler = ...` (any attribute of
# `mojo_toolchain`) to komira_mojo_toolchains. Keeping the call as it is gives
# the same action digests as a standalone checkout, so builds share its
# remote cache entries.
load("@komira//tools/build/toolchains:defs.bzl", "komira_mojo_toolchains")

komira_mojo_toolchains()
